    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/mvc/method/annotation/RequestMappingHandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>RequestMappingHandlerAdapter</code></a> implementation that adds a couple argument resolvers for controller method\nparameters used in the REST exporter controller. Also only looks for handler methods in the Spring Data REST provided\ncontroller classes to help isolate this handler adapter from other handler adapters the user might have configured in\ntheir Spring MVC context.",
      "translation": "实现了 `RequestMappingHandlerAdapter` 的类，它为用于 REST 导出器控制器的控制器方法参数添加了一对参数解析器。此外，该类仅在 Spring Data REST 提供的控制器类中查找处理器方法，以帮助将该处理器适配器与用户在 Spring MVC 上下文中可能配置的其他处理器适配器隔离开来。",
      "count": 1
    },
